up then i'll stop you are you still here

01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:00.820
The book!

01:14:11.550 --> 01:14:13.050
Farewell, dummy.

01:14:30.250 --> 01:14:36.750
Sarah, are you here? What happened?

01:14:38.160 --> 01:14:40.960
The Emissary has completed his task.

01:14:41.240 --> 01:14:42.420
But the Pa Wraiths.

01:14:43.100 --> 01:14:46.120
You've returned them to their prison within the fire cave.

01:14:46.820 --> 01:14:48.710
The book was the key, wasn't it?

01:14:49.440 --> 01:14:52.020
To a door that can never be opened again.

01:14:52.800 --> 01:14:54.380
And Ducard, is he dead?

01:14:55.610 --> 01:14:59.230
He's where he belongs, with the Pa Wraiths.

01:15:02.330 --> 01:15:04.480
Your time of trial has ended.

01:15:05.990 --> 01:15:07.400
You need to rest now.

01:15:09.450 --> 01:15:13.740
Tend to, as soon as I return to Deep Space Nine.

01:15:15.930 --> 01:15:17.090
That won't be necessary.

01:15:22.380 --> 01:15:23.640
You're with us now.

01:15:39.720 --> 01:15:42.060
We found the captain's runabout orbiting Bajor.

01:15:42.180 --> 01:15:44.960
But when we scanned the fire caves, there was no sign of him.

01:15:45.450 --> 01:15:46.110
Alien tea.

01:15:46.670 --> 01:15:46.990
Soothing.

01:15:47.700 --> 01:15:48.540
Better keep it coming.

01:15:49.310 --> 01:15:51.130
You're not calling off the search yet, are you?

01:15:51.550 --> 01:15:53.010
Not until we find your father.

01:15:55.340 --> 01:15:56.680
What about the Kendra province?

01:15:57.400 --> 01:15:58.560
Where he bought that land?

01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:01.100
Maybe he went there for some reason.

01:16:01.750 --> 01:16:03.610
Colonel Kira and Chief O'Brien

01:16:03.610 --> 01:16:05.570
have completed another scan of the planet.

01:16:06.010 --> 01:16:08.300
As far as they can tell, he is not there.

01:16:09.560 --> 01:16:10.780
Something's happened to Ben.

01:16:12.060 --> 01:16:13.800
Something bad, I can feel it.

01:16:16.450 --> 01:16:17.470
Prophets warned us.

01:16:21.360 --> 01:16:21.720
Hello?

01:16:24.030 --> 01:16:25.130
Is anyone here?

01:16:28.330 --> 01:16:28.730
Ben?

01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:30.660
Is that you?

01:16:31.930 --> 01:16:32.370
Cassidy.

01:16:35.030 --> 01:16:39.630
I've been so worried about you.

01:16:43.040 --> 01:16:43.580
Where are we?

01:16:44.650 --> 01:16:45.790
The celestial temple.

01:16:48.170 --> 01:16:48.930
